  'Amplia 2×, 3× ou 4× na GPU com Real-ESRGAN (Upscayl).': ['Upscales 2×, 3× or 4× on the GPU with Real-ESRGAN (Upscayl).', 'Amplía 2×, 3× o 4× en la GPU con Real-ESRGAN (Upscayl).'],
